    "claimPrompt": "Why did the United States government incarcerate about 120,000 people of Japanese ancestry, and why did it later call that decision a grave injustice? Use both sources, and compare this case with the treatment of dissenters during the First World War.",
    "contextualizationQuestions": [
      "What happened in December 1941, and what attitudes toward Asian Americans on the West Coast existed before the war?",
      "How had American ideas about civil rights changed between 1942 and 1988?"
    ],
    "due": {
      "days": 7,
