    "overview": "Read the Fourteenth Amendment, the lone dissent in Plessy v. Ferguson and Executive Order 9981 to understand the legal ground the civil rights movement stood on.",
    "problems": [
      {
        "prompt": "Quote the Fourteenth Amendment's equal protection clause. Whom does it protect, and against whose actions?"
