      {
        "prompt": "What did the Supreme Court decide in Plessy v. Ferguson (1896), and what happened across the South afterward?"
      },
      {
        "prompt": "Explain Justice Harlan's dissent in your own words. Why might a historian call it ahead of its time?"
      },
      {
        "prompt": "Homer Plessy's arrest was planned. Why would a civil rights committee want someone arrested? What does this tell you about the strategy of using courts to win rights?"
      },
      {
        "prompt": "What did Executive Order 9981 declare? Why might it have come in 1948, and why could Truman act without Congress?"
